      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This is becoming more relevant with a built-in tool available in Unity 6/Unity 6.1 called \"XR foveated rendering\". Currently, this is only a Steam Link option, but if built-in support existed for it, more middleware type apps(Virtual Desktop, Quest Link) may be able to support this.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
