  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-07-25T20:22:26.828Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I'd like to request adding Fixed Foveated Rendering on PC, possibly using variable-rate shading similar to the implementation in this tool: https://github.com/fholger/vrperfkit\nThis is a separate feature request to FSR upscaling, although the tool mentioned offers both.\nThis technique offers a very large performance increase on GPU-constrained hardware, and particularly important for those using higher-resolution VR headsets. I've measured frame-time reductions of up to 30% on a Valve Index, depending on radii settings.",
